  "description": "Run commands instantly. Select any shell command text or script files (.ps1, .bat, .cmd, .sh) and execute it right from WindowSill — no need to copy-paste into a terminal.\n\n      • Select a command anywhere on screen or script file from File Explorer and run it in one click\n      • Choose your shell: PowerShell 7, Windows PowerShell, CMD, or WSL\n      • Set the working directory and run as administrator\n      • View live output, copy results, or re-run with a single click\n      • Track multiple concurrent commands from the sill bar\n\n      The fastest way to run commands without switching to a terminal.",
